        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion 38-K2, Elite Collection Cambridge Knob with Matching Cambridge Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Cambridge Knob with Matching Rose has an effortlessness that elevates it from traditional to timeless. Something as elegant and beautiful as this Cambridge Knobset should not be labeled as traditional or old world, as it will look fantastic in almost any setting. Elegant knobs such as this one add a richness to homes. It is details like this that pull a space together and give rooms that luxe feel. Fusion's Elite Collection Cambridge Knob with Matching Cambridge Rosette will fit 1-3/8 inch to 2 inch thick doors and has an adjustable backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. Available in 5 finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Fusion 38 K2 Cambridge Knobset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid Brass/Bronze Construction</li>\r\n<li>Cycle Tested to ANSI Standards</li>\r\n<li>Exclusive Fusion knob spring assembly for lifetime performance.</li>\r\n<li>Reversible Latchbolt in matching/coordinating finish.</li>\r\n<li>Easy assembly with alignment block and rose posts.</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw rose cover.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Traditional Half-Round Cambridge Knobset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for  1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable for 2-3/8\" to 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass and Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Square corner latches and strike plates.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on one side of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on both sides of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Cambridge Knob with Matching Rose, Fusion 38-Z2",
